# ci-30: files allowed over the 500-line limit, and the number of top-level
# Go functions allowed over 50 lines. scripts/ci/line-limits.sh fails when a
# file over 500 lines has no row, when a listed file grows past its count, or
# when the function total exceeds functions_over_50. A PR may shrink a row or
# delete it, never add one or raise it. Each split item deletes its rows.
# Format: <repo-relative path> <max lines>
functions_over_50 44
